cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite both the paper and this software."
type: software
title: "CMLTRPCNN — physics-constrained neural network for ABO₃ microwave-dielectric permittivity prediction"
abstract: "Physics-constrained neural network that decomposes ABO₃ microwave-dielectric permittivity into Clausius-Mossotti, Lyddane-Sachs-Teller, octahedral-tilt and confidence-gated residual contributions. Includes the trained 5-seed ensemble, training pipeline, conformal calibration, applicability-domain analysis, virtual screening, and physics-constrained genetic-algorithm inverse design."
